            f"└─── ⋆⋅<tg-emoji emoji-id=\"5379553354076694057\">⭐</tg-emoji>⋅⋆ ───┘\n"
            f"\n┌─── <tg-emoji emoji-id=\"5381825232862483894\">🎮</tg-emoji> <b>ئاماری یارییەکان</b> ───┐\n"
            f"  <tg-emoji emoji-id=\"5463071033256848094\">🕹</tg-emoji> کۆی: <b>{games_played}</b>  │  <tg-emoji emoji-id=\"5462927083132970373\">🏆</tg-emoji> بردراو: <b>{games_won}</b>  │  {_TCH} <b>{_wr2}</b>\n"
            f"  <tg-emoji emoji-id=\"5424809463129347629\">🧮</tg-emoji> {math_quiz_played} │ <tg-emoji emoji-id=\"5472411062412254753\">🔤</tg-emoji> {scramble_played} │ <tg-emoji emoji-id=\"5280816565657300091\">🎲</tg-emoji> {dice_played} │ {_TGX}<tg-emoji emoji-id=\"5456586534583016832\">⭕</tg-emoji> {tictactoe_played}\n"
